  <item>
    <title>VOL.4丨街球王来了！（嘉宾：吴悠、杨舒越）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60e57469073b743020bb274d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60e57469073b743020bb274d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Jun 2021 06:22:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>街球王吴悠&amp;篮球宝贝杨舒越，做客本期《洛克屋中场秀》！从全民热潮到回归平静再到蓄势出发，中国街球在过去的二十年里经历了诸多起伏，而吴悠则是这段历史的重要见证者。你是何时喜欢上篮球的？谁是你少年时期最爱的篮球偶像？为了心爱的女孩，你会不会在篮球场向她勇敢求婚？这一期精彩的「CP对谈」，你不容错过！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">00:03:53</a> 吴悠跟篮球的初接触</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">00:12:38</a> 吴悠谈《灌篮高手》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">00:17:16</a> 艾弗森对吴悠的影响</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">00:20:13</a> 一位东北餐馆老板的「答案」情结</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">00:25:26</a> 「牛X的And1」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">00:32:25</a> 当街球变成职业</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">00:44:42</a> 杨舒越与吴悠的CP故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3083">00:51:23</a> 吴悠苦练「扣篮」的经历</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">00:58:27</a> 吴悠的职业篮球梦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">01:01:10</a> 「少年的心，会永远年轻」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4015">01:06:55</a> 杨舒越在首钢拉拉队的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4855">01:20:55</a> 《直到世界尽头》不插电翻唱</span></p>]]></description>
