  <item>
    <title>VOL.3丨 唱聊欧洲杯之神游英伦（嘉宾：刘阳子、DuduMassa）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60e57469073b743020bb274e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60e57469073b743020bb274e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Jun 2021 08:57:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欧洲杯虽迟但到！《洛克屋中场秀》的特辑「唱聊欧洲杯」也已上线开播！本届杯赛，英格兰、苏格兰与威尔士终于久违「团圆」。所以在这期节目中，我们邀请了西海之声电台的主播刘阳子，以及人称「海淀蔡依林」的知名球迷DuduMassa，先来聊聊那些关于英伦三岛的小故事。足球与音乐，这个夏天，一个都不能少！</span></p><p><span>洛克屋（熊花&amp;JOJO）歌曲推荐：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">00:17:49</a> The Business - England 5 Germany 1</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">00:27:25</a> The Beatles - Let it be不插电现场翻唱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3762">01:02:42</a> The Pogues - Dirty Old Town不插电现场翻唱</span></p><p><span>刘阳子歌曲推荐：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">00:11:35</a> The Chameleons - Up the Down Escalator</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">00:31:45</a> The Pogues - Fairytale of New York</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">00:47:09</a> Glasvegas - Flowers and Football Tops</span></p><p><span>DuduMassa歌曲推荐：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">00:14:19</a> The Fratellis - Chelsea Dagger</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">00:23:22</a> New Order - Bizarre Love Triangle（林忆莲《一个人》原版）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">00:29:51</a> David Bowie-The Man Who Sold The World</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">00:50:43</a> Snow Patrol - Take Back The City</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">00:55:55</a> Manic Street Preachers - Together Stronger (C'mon Wales)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">01:05:00</a> 欧洲杯不靠谱小预测！</span></p>]]></description>
